{"files": [{"id": 37855603, "name": "pbio.3001805.g004.tif", "size": 3616600, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/37855603", "supplied_md5": "a2ad83627ef85083e92b8a10eb732409", "computed_md5": "a2ad83627ef85083e92b8a10eb732409", "mimetype": "image/tiff"}], "folder_structure": {}, "authors": [{"id": 13955914, "full_name": "Jaewon Song", "first_name": "Jaewon", "last_name": "Song", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 10319219, "full_name": "Ryan D. Chow", "first_name": "Ryan D.", "last_name": "Chow", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 14009135, "full_name": "Mario A. Pe\u00f1a-Hern\u00e1ndez", "first_name": "Mario A.", "last_name": "Pe\u00f1a-Hern\u00e1ndez", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 8200, "full_name": "Li Zhang", "first_name": "Li", "last_name": "Zhang", "is_active": false, "url_name": "Li_Zhang", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 13955920, "full_name": "Skylar A. Loeb", "first_name": "Skylar A.", "last_name": "Loeb", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 13955923, "full_name": "Eui-Young So", "first_name": "Eui-Young", "last_name": "So", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 13955926, "full_name": "Olin D. Liang", "first_name": "Olin D.", "last_name": "Liang", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 129621, "full_name": "Ping Ren", "first_name": "Ping", "last_name": "Ren", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 127044, "full_name": "Sidi Chen", "first_name": "Sidi", "last_name": "Chen", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 8677404, "full_name": "Craig B. Wilen", "first_name": "Craig B.", "last_name": "Wilen", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 179163, "full_name": "Sanghyun Lee", "first_name": "Sanghyun", "last_name": "Lee", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://plos.figshare.com/articles/figure/LRRC15_enhances_SARS-CoV-2_attachment_to_the_surface_of_ACE2-expressing_cells_/21330295", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p>(<b>A</b>) HeLa-ACE2 cells were transduced with indicated activating sgRNAs or a LRRC15-expressing vector. Cell surface expression of ACE2 was measured by flow cytometry and calculated as MFI (<i>n</i> = 3). (<b>B</b>) HeLa or HeLa-ACE2 cells transduced with indicated activating sgRNAs were incubated with VSV\u0394G-S-SARS2 for 1 h on ice and washed 3 times with cold cell culture media. Viral genome copies were quantified by RT-qPCR and normalized to HeLa-ACE2 cells (<i>n</i> = 3). (<b>C</b>) Representative images of immunofluorescence staining of SARS-CoV-2 spike (green), LRRC15 (red), Actin (blue), and DAPI (cyan). Cells were inoculated with VSV\u0394G-S-SARS2 for 1 h on ice and incubated at 37\u00b0C for 1 h to allow internalization, followed by staining. The white arrowheads indicate spikes. The scale bar indicates 5 \u03bcm. (<b>D</b>) Quantification was performed by calculating the number of spikes on cells from multiple images per sample. (<b>E</b>) VSV\u0394G-S-SARS2 were incubated with ACE2-Fc, LRRC15-Fc, or IgG control for 1 h, prior to inoculating HeLa-ACE2 cells. Viral infectivity was quantified by measuring GFP signal at 20 hpi by flow cytometry and normalized to no antibody control (<i>n</i> = 6). Statistical significance was determined compared to IgG control at each dilution. (<b>F</b>, <b>G</b>) Competition assays between ACE2 and LRRC15 for immobilized His-tagged SARS-CoV-2 spike protein. Premixture of His-tagged protein at 4 different concentrations with a dilution series of Fc-tagged protein was added, and antihuman HRP determined the amount of Fc-tagged proteins remaining in the presence of competitor through a colorimetric readout. A combination of LRRC15-His and ACE2-Fc (<b>F</b>) or ACE2-His and LRRC15-Fc (<b>G</b>) was used. Data represent means \u00b1 SD (<b>B</b>, <b>D</b>, <b>E</b>). Data were analyzed by one-way ANOVA (<b>B</b>, <b>D</b>) or two-way ANOVA (<b>E</b>) with Dunnett multiple comparisons test. ns, not significant; *<i>p</i> < 0.05; **<i>p</i> < 0.01; ***<i>p</i> < 0.001; ****<i>p</i> < 0.0001. For underlying data, see <b><a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805#pbio.3001805.s003\" target=\"_blank\">S3 Data</a></b>. ACE2, angiotensin-converting enzyme 2; GFP, green fluorescent protein; hpi, hours postinfection; HRP, horseradish peroxidase; IgG, immunoglobulin G; LRRC15, leucin-rich repeat-containing 15; MFI, mean fluorescence intensity; RT-qPCR, quantitative reverse transcription PCR; SARS-CoV-2, Severe Acute Respiratory Syndrome Coronavirus 2; sgRNA, single guide RNA.</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 3616600, "created_date": "2022-10-13T18:04:50Z", "modified_date": "2023-06-13T06:56:19Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["inhibitory attachment factor", "div >< p", "although attachment factors", "regulates viral entry", "coreceptors facilitating entry", "lrrc15 directly binds", "identified human lrrc15", "converting enzyme 2", "human lung single", "2 cellular entry", "mediated viral entry", "entry receptor angiotensin", "lrrc15 inhibits sars", "2 entry", "mediated entry", "inhibits spike", "lrrc15 represents", "lrrc15 </", "trans </", "surface </", "spike protein", "protective role", "primarily detected", "physiological context", "particularly enriched", "moderate affinity", "largely unknown", "extensively studied", "binding domain", ">, suggesting", "19 patients"], "keywords": ["inhibitory attachment factor", "div >< p", "although attachment factors", "regulates viral entry", "coreceptors facilitating entry", "lrrc15 directly binds", "identified human lrrc15", "converting enzyme 2", "human lung single", "2 cellular entry", "mediated viral entry", "entry receptor angiotensin", "lrrc15 inhibits sars", "2 entry", "mediated entry", "inhibits spike", "lrrc15 represents", "lrrc15 </", "trans </", "surface </", "spike protein", "protective role", "primarily detected", "physiological context", "particularly enriched", "moderate affinity", "largely unknown", "extensively studied", "binding domain", ">, suggesting", "19 patients"], "categories": [{"id": 4, "title": "Biochemistry", "parent_id": 38, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 12, "title": "Cell Biology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 14, "title": "Molecular Biology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 19, "title": "Pharmacology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 46, "title": "Immunology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 734, "title": "Biological Sciences not elsewhere classified", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 64, "title": "Cancer", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 132, "title": "Infectious Diseases", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 134, "title": "Virology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}], "references": ["https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805"], "has_linked_file": false, "citation": "Song, Jaewon; Chow, Ryan D.; Pe\u00f1a-Hern\u00e1ndez, Mario A.; Zhang, Li; Loeb, Skylar A.; So, Eui-Young; et al. (2022). LRRC15 enhances SARS-CoV-2 attachment to the surface of ACE2-expressing cells.. PLOS Biology. Figure. https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805.g004", "related_materials": [{"id": 76501482, "identifier": "10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805", "title": "LRRC15 inhibits SARS-CoV-2 cellular entry